71 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (Every day, fraudsters find new ways to slip past the systems built to stop them. As digital payments become faster and easier, the vulnerabilities behind seemingly ordinary transactions become harder to spot. What if the next solution came from you?)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
72 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The Follow the Money: Innovation Challenge, organised by CSITM, IIM Bangalore, in partnership with PayU, invites students from diverse disciplines to tackle real-world challenges in digital payment security and financial fraud. Participants are encouraged to think beyond conventional approaches and develop innovative, practical solutions that bridge technology, business, policy and human behaviour.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
73 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (The challenge unfolds across two rounds, taking teams from initial idea submissions to a final showcase. Participants develop and refine their solutions, demonstrating originality, feasibility and potential for real-world impact. Finalist teams present their ideas at IIM Bangalore, where solutions are evaluated on problem understanding, innovation, practical feasibility, and clarity of execution.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
